{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めているのは**第740条**です。\n\n**第740条**：婚姻の届出は、法律（民法）や他の法令に違反していない場合に、市区町村の長（役所）によって受理され、婚姻が成立すると定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2128, "tokens_out": 124, "tokens": 2252, "latency_s": 8.67880962000163, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 889, "out": 54, "ms": 3682.5397560005513}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1239, "out": 70, "ms": 4988.592884999889}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["740"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第七百四十条が「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めています。同条は、婚姻の届出が関連する法令（例えば近親婚の禁止など）に違反しないことを認めた後でなければ、受理できないと定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3515, "tokens_out": 150, "tokens": 3665, "latency_s": 10.5899365460009, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 887, "out": 54, "ms": 4368.382432001454}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1237, "out": 40, "ms": 2752.136860999599}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1391, "out": 56, "ms": 3464.5632789997762}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["740"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」を定めている条文は、**民法第962条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n負担付遺贈の受遺者が、遺贈された財産の価額を超過する負担を履行する義務を免れる場合（免責）について定めています。具体的には、受遺者が遺贈の受領を拒否した場合や、遺贈の受領を拒否したとみなされる場合など、受遺者が負担の履行を拒否できる事由がある場合に、その免責が認められます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["962"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["962"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 128, "tokens": 1021, "latency_s": 8.266203535999011, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 893, "out": 128, "ms": 8263.530513999285}], "tools": [], "verify": [{"cited": ["962"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **Civil Code Article 1002 (民法第千二条)**.\n\nIt provides that a beneficiary of a legacy subject to a burden is liable to fulfill the burden only to the extent that the value of the legacy exceeds the burden. If the beneficiary renounces the legacy, they are exempt from liability.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2162, "tokens_out": 125, "tokens": 2287, "latency_s": 8.47760332100006, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 4325.032408998595}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 67, "ms": 4148.275644000023}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」を定めているのは、**民法第973条**です。\n\n**内容の要約：**\n遺贈を受けた者（受遺者）が、遺贈の承認または放棄をしない場合、遺言執行者や相続人は、受遺者に対してその意思を催告することができます。催告を受けた受遺者は、催告から1ヶ月以内に意思表示をしなければならないと定められています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 895, "tokens_out": 97, "tokens": 992, "latency_s": 7.106999921999886, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 895, "out": 97, "ms": 7104.371444000208}], "tools": [], "verify": [{"cited": ["973"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**Article 987 of the Civil Code** deals with the demand for acceptance or renunciation of a legacy by a legatee.\n\nIt provides that the legatee's obligor (or other interested parties) may demand from the legatee, within a reasonable period, that they declare their acceptance or renunciation of the legacy. If the legatee does not express their intention within that period to the obligor, it is deemed that they have accepted the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3641, "tokens_out": 196, "tokens": 3837, "latency_s": 14.12163536099979, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 893, "out": 60, "ms": 4596.497479999016}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1277, "out": 40, "ms": 2900.0073409988545}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1471, "out": 96, "ms": 6617.404966000322}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["987"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」を定めているのは、**民法第373条**です。\n\n**民法第373条**の内容は以下の通りです。\n抵当権者が抵当権の実行（競売）を申し立てた場合、抵当建物の使用者は、抵当権者がその使用者に対して引渡しを請求するまで、その引渡しを猶予することができます。これは、使用者が居住している建物を強制的に明け渡されることを防ぐための規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["373"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["373"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 893, "tokens_out": 114, "tokens": 1007, "latency_s": 7.417161900999417, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 893, "out": 114, "ms": 7414.690858999165}], "tools": [], "verify": [{"cited": ["373"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第395条（抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予）は、抵当権の目的である建物を賃貸借により使用・収益する者（抵当建物使用者）が、その建物の競売における買受人の買受けの時から6ヶ月間は、買受人に建物を引き渡すことを義務付けられないことを定めています。ただし、使用開始が買受けの後にされた場合や、相当の期間内に使用対価の支払いがない場合はこの猶予は適用されません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3649, "tokens_out": 208, "tokens": 3857, "latency_s": 14.260980586999722, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 891, "out": 58, "ms": 4808.563507000144}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1236, "out": 40, "ms": 2691.196858000694}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1522, "out": 110, "ms": 6754.702581998572}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["395"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「管理不全土地管理命令」を定めている主な条文は以下の通りです。\n\n*   **第264条の9**: 裁判所が、所有者による土地の管理が不適当で他人の権利を侵害する恐れがある場合などに、管理不全土地管理命令を出すことを定めています。\n*   **第264条の10**: 管理不全土地管理人が、命令の対象となった土地や動産の管理・処分などの権限を有することを定めています。\n*   **第264条の11**: 管理不全土地管理人が、善良な管理者の注意をもって権限を行使しなければならない義務を定めています。\n*   **第264条の12**: 管理人が任務に違反して損害を与えた場合などに、裁判所がその解任を命じることを定めています。\n*   **第264条の13**: 管理人が裁判所が定める額の費用の前払及び報酬を受けることができることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9", "264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2140, "tokens_out": 267, "tokens": 2407, "latency_s": 16.541653682001197, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 888, "out": 53, "ms": 3883.33534999947}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1252, "out": 214, "ms": 12654.091522001181}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["264-9", "264-10", "264-11", "264-12", "264-13"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article dealing with「管理不全土地管理命令」is **Article 264-9 of the Civil Code** (民法 第二百六十四条の九).\n\nIt provides that when a landowner's management of land is inappropriate and infringes or threatens to infringe upon another's rights or legally protected interests, the court may issue a management order for the land (管理不全土地管理命令) to appoint a manager to handle the land.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2136, "tokens_out": 145, "tokens": 2281, "latency_s": 10.47963457700098, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 886, "out": 53, "ms": 3987.976864000302}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1250, "out": 92, "ms": 6487.6034279986925}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
