{"id": "dev005-en", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The term「受領遅滞」(creditor's delay in acceptance) is not defined in a single article but is a legal concept primarily addressed in **Article 494** (regarding deposit when a creditor refuses acceptance) and **Article 495** (regarding the method of such deposit). These articles provide that a debtor may deposit the subject matter of performance with a deposit office when the creditor refuses to accept performance or is unable to accept it, thereby discharging the debt.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["494", "495"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["494", "495"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 8, "tokens_in": 15955, "tokens_out": 451, "tokens": 16406, "latency_s": 33.87100239099891, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 885, "out": 52, "ms": 5439.436485999977}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 40, "ms": 2716.2093730003107}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1447, "out": 40, "ms": 2320.258100000501}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1607, "out": 40, "ms": 2901.854641999307}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1792, "out": 40, "ms": 3376.635554001041}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1999, "out": 40, "ms": 2222.856299000341}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 2210, "out": 56, "ms": 3809.189597999648}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 2572, "out": 40, "ms": 2094.11090300091}, {"node": "draft.force", "in": 2192, "out": 103, "ms": 8976.502052999422}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "478"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "493"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", 