{"id": "dev006-ja", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "健康保険法第百六十条の二の直後の条文は**第百六十条の三**です。\n\n**第百六十条の三**の内容は、協会が定めた子ども・子育て支援金率について、厚生労働大臣がこれを承認し、その旨を公表しなければならないこと、および承認されない場合の処理を定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3705, "tokens_out": 174, "tokens": 3879, "latency_s": 11.533376469000359, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 3835.723993999636}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1293, "out": 44, "ms": 2773.3431500000734}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1515, "out": 74, "ms": 4918.468279998706}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-en", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "The article immediately after the one on「子ども・子育て支援金率」(Article 160-2) is **Article 160-3 of the Health Insurance Act**.\n\nIt provides that insurers must establish a **reserve fund** at the end of each fiscal year to prepare for expenses related to health insurance operations, following regulations set by government ordinance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5435, "tokens_out": 220, "tokens": 5655, "latency_s": 14.99492327400003, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 892, "out": 56, "ms": 4644.392551999772}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1288, "out": 44, "ms": 2629.796812998393}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1510, "out": 44, "ms": 3106.727628999579}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1745, "out": 76, "ms": 4607.438121998712}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-ja", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "刑法第72条（法律上の減軽と刑の選択）の直後にあるのは**刑法第73条**です。\n\n**刑法第73条**の内容は要約すると以下の通りです。\n「法律上の減軽」によって刑が軽くなる場合、その減軽後の刑が「法定刑の下限」よりも軽い場合は、その下限を基準に減軽し、それでもなお軽い場合は、さらに減軽することができます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["72", "73"], "invalid": ["73"], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["72"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 4244, "tokens_out": 363, "tokens": 4607, "latency_s": 25.539121821000663, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 897, "out": 56, "ms": 4473.1389219996345}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1218, "out": 106, "ms": 6518.92596900143}, {"node": "revise.agent", "in": 1063, "out": 105, "ms": 6320.30697799928}, {"node": "revise.agent", "in": 1066, "out": 96, "ms": 8218.66355200109}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["72", "73"], "invalid": ["73"]}, {"cited": ["72", "73", "74"], "invalid": ["73", "74"]}, {"cited": ["72", "73"], "invalid": ["73"]}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-en", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 72 is **Article 77** of the Penal Code. It defines the crime of **内乱 (sedition)**, specifying that anyone who violently disrupts the state's governing system, excludes state authority, or destroys the basic order of governance is guilty of sedition. It outlines penalties: death or life imprisonment for ringleaders; life imprisonment or 3+ years for planners or leaders; 1–10 years for participants; and up to 3 years for followers. Attempt is punishable except for mere participants.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["72", "77"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["72", "77"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 5, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 6613, "tokens_out": 351, "tokens": 6964, "latency_s": 23.052483464000034, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 893, "out": 56, "ms": 3718.0333509986667}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1214, "out": 75, "ms": 4761.82074999997}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1319, "out": 39, "ms": 2136.2351150000904}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1449, "out": 67, "ms": 4864.581272000578}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1738, "out": 114, "ms": 7563.0623799988825}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "73"}, "ok": false}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "72"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "77"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["72", "77"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-ja", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "健康保険法で「資格の得喪の確認」を定めているのは第39条です。その直後の条文は**第40条**です。\n\n**第40条の内容要約**: 被保険者の標準報酬月額を、その報酬月額に基づき等級区分によって定めることを規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6474, "tokens_out": 204, "tokens": 6678, "latency_s": 17.121123961000194, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 896, "out": 55, "ms": 4735.7882559990685}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1269, "out": 41, "ms": 3386.763606000386}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1581, "out": 41, "ms": 2752.7756100007537}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 2728, "out": 67, "ms": 6238.954912998452}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-en", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 39 (資格の得喪の確認) in the Health Insurance Act is **Article 40 (標準報酬月額)**.\n\nArticle 40 establishes the standard remuneration monthly amount (標準報酬月額) based on the insured person's remuneration monthly amount, defining the grade classifications and corresponding amounts used for calculating insurance benefits.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6454, "tokens_out": 210, "tokens": 6664, "latency_s": 18.642931581000084, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 891, "out": 55, "ms": 4618.061408000358}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1264, "out": 41, "ms": 2834.7893619993556}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1576, "out": 41, "ms": 4309.29366700002}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 2723, "out": 73, "ms": 6873.318122001365}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-ja", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "「譲受会社による債務の引受け」を定めているのは会社法第23条です。その直後の条文は第23条の2（id 23-2）です。\n\n**第23条の2**\n事業譲渡で債権者を害する旨を知って行った場合、譲受会社は承継した財産の価額を限度として、債務の履行を請求される責任を負う。ただし、債権者を害することを知らなかった場合は責任を負わない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23", "23-2"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 3875, "tokens_out": 249, "tokens": 4124, "latency_s": 18.578077808999296, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 898, "out": 57, "ms": 4661.012653999933}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1276, "out": 84, "ms": 5644.808177999948}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1701, "out": 108, "ms": 8264.875329999995}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-3"}, "ok": false}], "verify": [{"cited": ["23", "23-2"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-en", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 23-2 (譲受会社による債務の引受け) is **Article 24** of the Companies Act.\n\n**Article 24** provides that if a transferor company transfers its business to a transferee company and the transferee company continues to use the transferor company's trade name, the transferee company is deemed to have assumed the debts incurred by the transferor company in the course of the business, unless the transferee company has publicly announced that it does not assume such debts.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "24"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["24"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3797, "tokens_out": 210, "tokens": 4007, "latency_s": 15.399939704000644, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 893, "out": 57, "ms": 4819.911627999318}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 42, "ms": 3169.029024998963}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1633, "out": 111, "ms": 7403.263210999285}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["23-2", "24"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-ja", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "draft_verify", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "民法で「弁済の場所及び時間」を定めているのは第484条です。その直後の条文は**第485条**です。\n\n**第485条の内容要約**: 弁済の費用について別段の合意がない場合、その費用は債務者の負担となります。ただし、債権者が住所の移転などの行為により弁済の費用を増加させた場合は、その増加分は債権者の負担となります。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3573, "tokens_out": 194, "tokens": 3767, "latency_s": 12.67398032300116, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "draft.agent", "in": 895, "out": 54, "ms": 4073.1461360010144}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1251, "out": 40, "ms": 2783.365800998581}, {"node": "draft.agent", "in": 1427, "out": 100, "ms": 5810.201165000763}], "tools": [{"node": "draft", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "draft", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [{"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": []}], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
